<title>USA: Great Pines is awarded $2.1 mln by jury.</title>
<headline>Great Pines is awarded $2.1 mln by jury.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Pines Water Co said Friday it had been awarded $2.1 million by a federal court jury in its lawsuit against Liqui-Box Corp.</p>
<p>Great Pines had sued Liqui-Box over its &quot;de-cap dispensing system,&quot; saying it was defective and did not function with Great Pines's five-gallon bottles of water.</p>
<p>Great Pines said the jury ordered Liqui-Box to pay Great Pines $799,870 in actual damages and $1.36 million in punitive damages plus interest.</p>
<p>Liqui-Box said it was unable to comment on the decision.</p>
</text>
